        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5056HE, Hammered Egg Knob with Hammered Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith beautiful texture to add a point of interest, the Hammered Egg Knob with Square Rose is the perfect accompaniment to any traditionally styled home. The egg knob paired with the square rose is an interesting combination of shapes that is not only aesthetically pleasing to the eye, but is easily transferred from the southwestern design for which this knob and rosette pair was made to more modern homes as well. Neither too overwhelming nor too plain, this door knob and rose set's attention to detail is on par with even the most put together rooms. The Hammered Egg Knob with Hammered Square Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Rustic Hammered Egg Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the American Heritage Hammered Egg Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2-3/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-5056HE-finish.jpg?v=1704354524\" width=\"456\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hammered Egg Knob with Square Rose",
                "description": "With beautiful texture to add a point of interest, the Hammered Egg Knob with Square Rose is the perfect accompaniment to any traditionally styled home. The egg knob paired with the square rose is an interesting combination of shapes that is not only aesthetically pleasing to the eye, but is easily transferred from the southwestern design for which this knob and rosette pair was made to more modern homes as well. Neither too overwhelming nor too plain, this door knob and rose set's attention to detail is on par with even the most put together rooms. The Hammered Egg Knob with Hammered Square Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Hammered Egg Knob with Hammered Square Roses, Emtek 5056HE, Emtek 5106HE, Emtek 5206HE, EMT-5056HE, Hammered Egg Knob with Square Roses, Hammered Egg with Hammered Rosettes, Rustic Hammered Egg Knobs, American Heritage Hammered Egg Knobsets,"
